        "created_at": "2015-04-30T15:04:22.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Here are a few recommendations, organized vaguely from light to heavy. A few have already been mentioned, but are worth repeating.</p><ul>\n<li>Dixit</li>\n<li>Bohnanza</li>\n</ul><ul>\n<li>Blueprints</li>\n<li>Hanabi</li>\n<li>Glory to Rome (if you can find it)</li>\n<li>Race for the Galaxy</li>\n<li>Ginkgopolis</li>\n<li>Dungeon Lords</li>\n</ul><p>&nbsp;</p>",
