        "created_at": "2015-06-29T21:50:54.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Forbidden Island is a good co-op game (and forbidden desert, so I've heard, but I haven't played that one) made by the same guys as pandemic, so it plays similarly. Another good one (even though its not co-op) is robo rally, it's a more silly game that's pretty funny. Both of these appeared earlier in this thread, and I got them both and love them.</p>",
